# Idea Tournament Protocol

## Purpose

Force opportunity hypotheses to compete HEAD-TO-HEAD before synthesis.
Linear merge loses signal — adversarial debate surfaces the strongest
ideas by testing each against every alternative on 5 scoring criteria.

## When This Runs

Phase 2.7 in Stage0 pipeline. ONLY activated when:
1. Pattern matcher (Phase 2.5C) found >= 3 distinct patterns, AND
2. Keyword pre-filter detects >= 3 opportunity-related keywords in Phase 2.5C output

If either condition fails, tournament is SKIPPED — zero cost.

## Input

The tournament-executor agent receives:
- `evidence_vault_path` — path to session's evidence-vault.md
- `pattern_matcher_top5` — Phase 2.5C output (top 5 scored patterns)
- `founder_context` — Phase 0 intent_meta (capital, skills, location, timeline)
- `first_principles_hypotheses` — (OPTIONAL) Phase 2.6 output. When present, these novel hypotheses enter the tournament alongside pattern-matcher results. May be null if Phase 2.6 was skipped or failed.

## Output

Write to session plan directory:
```
plans/{session_id}/tournament-result.md
```

